1
00:01:28,027 --> 00:01:33,398
[Adapted from Che Ye Liu Xiang's
novel of the same name]

2
00:01:33,398 --> 00:01:38,066
[Episode 9]

3
00:02:03,292 --> 00:02:04,853
Fan Fan.

4
00:02:04,853 --> 00:02:06,478
It's been two months.

5
00:02:34,791 --> 00:02:36,083
Fan Fan.

6
00:02:36,875 --> 00:02:38,541
I want congee.

7
00:02:39,341 --> 00:02:40,883
Pork congee?

8
00:02:42,625 --> 00:02:44,417
Don't add chopped spring onions.

9
00:02:45,334 --> 00:02:47,291
If I don't add spring onions,

10
00:02:47,291 --> 00:02:49,125
it'll be too gamey.

11
00:02:52,792 --> 00:02:55,709
Then just add more shredded ginger.

12
00:02:57,386 --> 00:03:00,052
I'll chop some celery for you instead.

13
00:03:42,124 --> 00:03:44,249
<i>The heat on the left
and right burners is different.</i>

14
00:03:44,249 --> 00:03:46,082
<i>The right one is for making soup.</i>

15
00:03:47,125 --> 00:03:49,546
<i>The soup pot is on the right, too.</i>

16
00:03:50,417 --> 00:03:51,958
<i>This place...</i>

17
00:03:51,958 --> 00:03:55,125
<i>How is it exactly like the house in Yunjing?</i>

18
00:04:18,041 --> 00:04:19,166
<i>Big Bro.</i>

19
00:04:19,166 --> 00:04:20,832
<i>You don't have to enter the kitchen anymore.</i>

20
00:04:20,832 --> 00:04:22,416
<i>Just leave it to me.</i>

21
00:04:25,791 --> 00:04:29,003
- What's wrong?
- No, it's nothing.

22
00:04:33,249 --> 00:04:35,124
Why are you so clumsy?

23
00:04:35,124 --> 00:04:36,666
Back in Yunjing,

24
00:04:36,666 --> 00:04:38,624
you always bumped into this cabinet, too.

25
00:04:40,250 --> 00:04:41,541
Yeah.

26
00:04:42,817 --> 00:04:44,957
This place...

27
00:04:44,957 --> 00:04:47,166
is exactly like Yunjing.

28
00:04:54,082 --> 00:04:57,041
I asked Lin Zi Yang
to help me with the renovation.

29
00:04:57,041 --> 00:04:59,624
He's so careless.

30
00:05:00,791 --> 00:05:02,124
When the time comes,

31
00:05:02,124 --> 00:05:03,999
get your brother
and Lin Zi Yang out for dinner.

32
00:05:03,999 --> 00:05:05,570
I'll make him apologize.

33
00:05:10,249 --> 00:05:11,791
Big Bro.

34
00:05:11,791 --> 00:05:13,874
Where did you get this videotape?

35
00:05:15,249 --> 00:05:17,197
Look at the clarity.

36
00:05:17,197 --> 00:05:18,822
Does it look like a videotape?

37
00:05:23,416 --> 00:05:26,582
It's much clearer
than the ones in the video halls.

38
00:05:28,041 --> 00:05:30,082
Watching "The Bride with White Hair" again?

39
00:05:33,708 --> 00:05:36,958
How many times have you watched this movie?

40
00:05:38,291 --> 00:05:40,249
I don't remember.

41
00:05:40,249 --> 00:05:43,124
Probably many times.

42
00:05:44,374 --> 00:05:46,582
What exactly is this movie about?

43
00:05:47,332 --> 00:05:49,582
It's about Zhuo Yi Hang,
a disciple of a prestigious sect,

44
00:05:49,582 --> 00:05:52,457
falling in love with the witch Lian Ni Shang.

45
00:05:53,874 --> 00:05:56,582
<i>Can you make my white hair turn black again?</i>

46
00:05:56,582 --> 00:05:58,791
What she meant by that was...

47
00:05:59,957 --> 00:06:01,999
Can spilled water...

48
00:06:01,999 --> 00:06:03,999
ever be gathered back?

49
00:06:10,416 --> 00:06:13,499
It's not that Lian Ni Shang
didn't love Zhuo Yi Hang.

50
00:06:14,625 --> 00:06:17,316
She couldn't come freely,

51
00:06:17,316 --> 00:06:19,530
but she could leave freely.

52
00:06:31,749 --> 00:06:34,124
If you like watching movies so much,

53
00:06:34,124 --> 00:06:35,915
then move in with me.

54
00:06:57,415 --> 00:06:59,374
As for Xiao Ping's job,

55
00:06:59,374 --> 00:07:01,249
I'll leave it in your hands, Mr. Lu.

56
00:07:02,207 --> 00:07:03,957
Don't be so formal, Mr. Lin.

57
00:07:03,957 --> 00:07:06,949
It's my honor that you thought of me for help.

58
00:07:06,949 --> 00:07:08,113
Here.

59
00:07:08,113 --> 00:07:09,404
Cheers.

60
00:07:15,707 --> 00:07:19,062
Well then, let's leave it to Shen Zhi Qin.

61
00:07:20,290 --> 00:07:22,165
Let me introduce you. This is Shen Zhi Qin.

62
00:07:22,165 --> 00:07:25,124
The best trader in the futures market.

63
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:27,165
Hand Xiao Ping over to him.

64
00:07:27,165 --> 00:07:28,332
I'll give him a strict order.

65
00:07:28,332 --> 00:07:32,020
He must train Xiao Ping to be an expert.

66
00:07:33,915 --> 00:07:35,917
The name Shen Zhi Qin...

67
00:07:35,917 --> 00:07:38,301
sounds like someone who gets things done.

68
00:07:38,999 --> 00:07:40,165
I'm just an ordinary citizen.

69
00:07:40,165 --> 00:07:42,103
I have to be diligent to survive.

70
00:07:43,124 --> 00:07:44,832
He's just like that.

71
00:07:44,832 --> 00:07:45,915
He has character.

72
00:07:45,915 --> 00:07:47,249
I like it.

73
00:07:48,165 --> 00:07:50,915
Mr. Lu, this toast is for you, too.

74
00:07:50,915 --> 00:07:52,999
Thank you for the job opportunity.

75
00:07:52,999 --> 00:07:55,040
Zi Yang, we're both straightforward people.

76
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:56,457
Let's not play games.

77
00:07:57,165 --> 00:07:59,374
I'm not doing this to do you a favor.

78
00:07:59,374 --> 00:08:03,582
It's purely to please the big lord behind you.

79
00:08:04,249 --> 00:08:06,000
This is a partnership.

80
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,540
It's not about who's pleasing whom.

81
00:08:07,540 --> 00:08:09,374
Lv Qing will be here soon.

82
00:08:10,582 --> 00:08:12,749
Mr. Lu, I'm finished eating.

83
00:08:12,749 --> 00:08:14,665
If there's nothing else, I'll head out.

84
00:08:15,499 --> 00:08:18,290
Xiao Ping, be at the office
at 9:00 A.M. tomorrow.

85
00:08:18,290 --> 00:08:20,009
You'll be following me from now on.

86
00:08:24,707 --> 00:08:25,749
Don't take it personally.

87
00:08:25,749 --> 00:08:27,707
He's just like that by nature.

88
00:08:27,707 --> 00:08:29,582
He's gone dull from watching the market.

89
00:08:29,582 --> 00:08:31,121
Come.

90
00:08:34,999 --> 00:08:39,040
But... he's even so arrogant
toward you, Mr. Lu.

91
00:08:39,040 --> 00:08:40,957
The man truly has talent.

92
00:08:40,957 --> 00:08:43,082
- If he's arrogant, so be it.
- That won't do.

93
00:08:43,082 --> 00:08:45,540
No matter how capable he is,
can he beat you, Mr. Lu?

94
00:08:45,540 --> 00:08:47,749
You're far too gracious.

95
00:08:47,749 --> 00:08:49,915
If a person has real talent,

96
00:08:49,915 --> 00:08:52,374
what does that have to do with being social?

97
00:08:55,209 --> 00:08:56,832
Hey, Lv Qing.

98
00:08:56,832 --> 00:08:59,082
Drink up as a penalty!

99
00:09:01,875 --> 00:09:03,500
Lv Qing.

100
00:09:03,500 --> 00:09:05,995
We haven't seen each other for years.

101
00:09:05,995 --> 00:09:07,957
Isn't it because you're so busy, Mr. Lu?

102
00:09:07,957 --> 00:09:09,124
Look at what you're saying.

103
00:09:09,124 --> 00:09:11,582
Zi Yang knows how many times
I've invited you out.

104
00:09:11,582 --> 00:09:13,540
But you've been ignoring me.

105
00:09:13,540 --> 00:09:15,540
Well, I'm here to take my penalty.

106
00:09:21,749 --> 00:09:24,707
Lv Qing, I didn't mean to blame you.

107
00:09:24,707 --> 00:09:26,790
I just have this one bad habit.

108
00:09:26,790 --> 00:09:28,708
I'm overly attentive.

109
00:09:28,708 --> 00:09:32,082
I almost scared Xiao Fan
into closing his account with me.

110
00:09:32,082 --> 00:09:34,124
Mr. Lu, you're being too modest.

111
00:09:34,124 --> 00:09:35,999
Aren't you just scaring our Xiao Fan?

112
00:09:35,999 --> 00:09:38,999
Look at that. He just got here,
and he's already defending his own.

113
00:09:41,833 --> 00:09:44,292
Big Bro, why are you here?

114
00:09:44,292 --> 00:09:47,332
They're here for me. How could I not come?

115
00:09:47,332 --> 00:09:49,207
Are you really letting my brother do this?

116
00:09:49,207 --> 00:09:50,666
I'm afraid of causing you trouble.

117
00:09:50,666 --> 00:09:52,104
It's fine.

118
00:09:54,291 --> 00:09:55,582
By the way,

119
00:09:55,582 --> 00:09:59,582
the CSRC might issue
new regulations next quarter

120
00:09:59,582 --> 00:10:02,249
to regulate the securities market.

121
00:10:04,749 --> 00:10:07,166
It's only a matter of time.

122
00:10:07,166 --> 00:10:10,541
It's not a question of if, but when.

123
00:10:11,749 --> 00:10:14,041
Whether the CSRC regulates it or not,

124
00:10:14,041 --> 00:10:16,916
won't you still make a fortune, Mr. Lu?

125
00:10:16,916 --> 00:10:18,916
I still need everyone's support.

126
00:10:18,916 --> 00:10:20,832
Right? Come on, cheers.

127
00:10:20,832 --> 00:10:21,957
Cheers.

128
00:10:25,772 --> 00:10:28,109
[Textile Bureau]

129
00:10:36,542 --> 00:10:38,292
Big Bro, you should head out first.

130
00:10:38,292 --> 00:10:40,082
Your car is too conspicuous.

131
00:10:40,082 --> 00:10:41,677
Look at you now.

132
00:10:43,749 --> 00:10:45,291
Good morning, Ms. Xu.

133
00:10:45,291 --> 00:10:46,957
You're a dark horse, Fan Fan.

134
00:10:46,957 --> 00:10:48,922
You even have a private car now.

135
00:10:49,749 --> 00:10:52,374
And this is...

136
00:10:52,374 --> 00:10:54,138
This is my brother.

137
00:10:55,124 --> 00:10:56,291
It's a pleasure to meet you.

138
00:10:56,291 --> 00:10:58,124
Fan Fan mentions you all the time.

139
00:10:58,124 --> 00:11:00,332
He said you're a publicity officer
at the Textile Bureau.

140
00:11:00,332 --> 00:11:01,791
A real wordsmith.

141
00:11:01,791 --> 00:11:04,074
A great talent. Impressive.

142
00:11:05,416 --> 00:11:07,147
He's my brother-in-law.

143
00:11:10,499 --> 00:11:11,957
I know everything about Fan Fan.

144
00:11:11,957 --> 00:11:14,038
Isn't he just waiting for a divorce?

145
00:11:15,292 --> 00:11:16,332
Big Bro.

146
00:11:16,332 --> 00:11:18,124
I have to pick up the plan sheet this morning.

147
00:11:18,124 --> 00:11:19,375
I'll get going now.

148
00:11:19,375 --> 00:11:21,047
Let's go, Ms. Xu.

149
00:11:43,166 --> 00:11:45,543
I want fish congee tomorrow morning.

150
00:11:45,543 --> 00:11:48,666
Big Bro, how about I make it on the weekend?

151
00:11:48,666 --> 00:11:51,417
I've been working the morning shift lately.

152
00:11:51,417 --> 00:11:53,750
Actually, you don't have to come.

153
00:11:56,541 --> 00:11:59,082
I'll make the congee every morning
and bring it to you.

154
00:11:59,082 --> 00:12:00,543
Whatever.

155
00:12:13,749 --> 00:12:17,249
Big Bro, if there's nothing else,
I'll head out.

156
00:12:25,374 --> 00:12:28,957
Is there anything you want me to buy for you?

157
00:12:30,582 --> 00:12:32,268
Or something you need me to get?

158
00:12:33,999 --> 00:12:36,051
Should I help make a spare key?

159
00:12:39,749 --> 00:12:42,109
You want to give me a key?

160
00:12:43,750 --> 00:12:45,791
Big Bro, there's no need.

161
00:12:45,791 --> 00:12:47,916
I'm always available. No need for a key.

162
00:12:47,916 --> 00:12:49,707
Lu Xiao Fan.

163
00:12:49,707 --> 00:12:52,666
Don't think your ass is that valuable.

164
00:12:55,666 --> 00:12:59,124
Then... I'll bring the congee tomorrow morning.

165
00:12:59,124 --> 00:13:01,416
If you dare to leave today,

166
00:13:01,416 --> 00:13:03,916
don't bother coming back tomorrow.

167
00:13:13,999 --> 00:13:17,475
Then I... I'll move in this weekend.

168
00:13:18,349 --> 00:13:19,641
Wait.

169
00:13:31,625 --> 00:13:32,957
Big Bro, this...

170
00:13:32,957 --> 00:13:35,457
If you ever throw this in the trash again,

171
00:13:36,124 --> 00:13:38,124
I'll throw you in there, too.

172
00:14:17,332 --> 00:14:20,124
Fan Fan, are you moving in for good?

173
00:14:23,207 --> 00:14:24,999
It's more convenient to move there.

174
00:14:24,999 --> 00:14:26,582
This place is a bit small.

175
00:14:26,582 --> 00:14:29,207
It'll be more comfortable
for you and Ping Ping.

176
00:14:29,207 --> 00:14:31,522
Then thank Lv Qing for me.

177
00:14:32,624 --> 00:14:34,541
Behave yourself when you're there.

178
00:14:34,541 --> 00:14:36,696
Don't cause trouble for Lv Qing.

179
00:14:37,625 --> 00:14:39,375
Oh, Lv Qing loves congee.

180
00:14:39,375 --> 00:14:42,409
Can you make it? Or should I go make it?

181
00:14:43,416 --> 00:14:45,291
No need, Mom.

182
00:14:45,291 --> 00:14:46,624
This congee is quite a hassle.

183
00:14:46,624 --> 00:14:48,456
You don't know the recipe.

184
00:14:49,499 --> 00:14:51,291
Lv Qing is such a good child.

185
00:14:51,291 --> 00:14:53,916
He's never made us feel awkward
and helps us out in every way.

186
00:14:53,916 --> 00:14:56,332
- He really is...
- Mom.

187
00:14:56,332 --> 00:14:57,951
Warm up the food.

188
00:14:58,874 --> 00:15:00,582
Eat, eat, eat. All you know is eating.

189
00:15:00,582 --> 00:15:02,124
Your brother finally came home for once.

190
00:15:02,124 --> 00:15:03,707
Isn't talking more important than eating?

191
00:15:03,707 --> 00:15:07,033
Once you warm it up, we can eat together.

192
00:15:08,374 --> 00:15:11,083
Fan Fan, stay for dinner before you go.

193
00:15:17,416 --> 00:15:18,458
Xiao Fan.

194
00:15:18,458 --> 00:15:20,083
Do you know how much money was made

195
00:15:20,083 --> 00:15:22,077
after Bei Lv Qing opened that account?

196
00:15:23,333 --> 00:15:24,999
I don't care about those things.

197
00:15:24,999 --> 00:15:27,208
Do you know how much that one trade made?

198
00:15:27,208 --> 00:15:30,291
1.6 million, Xiao Fan!

199
00:15:30,958 --> 00:15:32,791
My monthly salary is only 2,000 yuan.

200
00:15:32,791 --> 00:15:34,499
That's only 25,000 a year.

201
00:15:36,624 --> 00:15:38,291
I'd have to work myself to the bone

202
00:15:38,291 --> 00:15:39,958
for 70 years to earn that much.

203
00:15:39,958 --> 00:15:41,958
He got it in the blink of an eye.

204
00:15:43,166 --> 00:15:45,707
How do you know about Lv Qing's trades?

205
00:15:45,707 --> 00:15:47,916
His trades are all handled by Shen Zhi Qin.

206
00:15:47,916 --> 00:15:49,291
Yeah.

207
00:15:49,291 --> 00:15:51,999
I took a peek while he was in the bathroom.

208
00:15:51,999 --> 00:15:54,041
Why did you peek at his account?

209
00:15:54,041 --> 00:15:55,124
What's the big deal?

210
00:15:55,124 --> 00:15:57,541
You talk about the Bei family
like they're pure saints.

211
00:15:57,541 --> 00:15:58,541
But after all is said and done,

212
00:15:58,541 --> 00:16:00,374
they just won't let us in on the money.

213
00:16:00,374 --> 00:16:03,738
Lu Xiao Ping, can you just stop for once?

214
00:16:07,916 --> 00:16:09,707
Ping Ping.

215
00:16:09,707 --> 00:16:11,457
Fan Fan, let's eat first.

216
00:16:11,457 --> 00:16:14,082
No thanks. Lv Qing is waiting
for me downstairs.

217
00:16:15,556 --> 00:16:16,708
Fan Fan.

218
00:16:16,708 --> 00:16:18,151
Fan Fan!

219
00:16:20,666 --> 00:16:22,051
Fan Fan.

220
00:16:23,207 --> 00:16:24,333
I know.

221
00:16:24,333 --> 00:16:27,082
Your brother really is a hopeless case.

222
00:16:27,082 --> 00:16:29,320
But he's still family, after all.

223
00:16:29,320 --> 00:16:30,624
Mom.

224
00:16:30,624 --> 00:16:32,589
I can't make the decisions on this.

225
00:16:33,885 --> 00:16:36,525
Fan Fan, take care of yourself.

226
00:16:55,207 --> 00:16:57,005
Is your mother doing okay?

227
00:16:58,332 --> 00:16:59,988
She's fine.

228
00:17:01,207 --> 00:17:03,416
She misses you a lot.

229
00:17:03,416 --> 00:17:04,582
She even said

230
00:17:04,582 --> 00:17:06,291
she wanted to make congee for you herself.

231
00:17:06,291 --> 00:17:08,255
She thinks mine isn't good enough.

232
00:17:10,416 --> 00:17:11,999
When should we bring her over?

233
00:17:11,999 --> 00:17:13,983
I'll take her around to see the sights.

234
00:17:16,332 --> 00:17:18,124
If she comes here,

235
00:17:18,124 --> 00:17:21,124
she'd probably have no peace
because of your brother.

236
00:17:50,332 --> 00:17:53,107
Mr. Shen, are you watching the market?

237
00:18:04,916 --> 00:18:06,916
This is a real eye-opener for me.

238
00:18:06,916 --> 00:18:09,832
No wonder so many people
are sucking up to my brother.

239
00:18:09,832 --> 00:18:12,014
So, that's how it is.

240
00:18:15,291 --> 00:18:17,624
Thanks for the hard work.
You all did well today.

241
00:18:17,624 --> 00:18:19,207
Don't just stare at the screens all day.

242
00:18:19,207 --> 00:18:21,749
Go to the VIP room more often
and listen for news.

243
00:18:26,582 --> 00:18:28,874
Who knows who will be the boss in the future?

244
00:18:52,166 --> 00:18:53,832
Why is it you again?

245
00:18:53,832 --> 00:18:55,518
Do you have a problem with that?

246
00:18:57,582 --> 00:18:58,916
Where's Li Wen Xi?

247
00:18:59,600 --> 00:19:00,891
We broke up.

248
00:19:02,916 --> 00:19:04,041
Broke up?

249
00:19:04,041 --> 00:19:06,416
Didn't you notice I haven't been
wearing my ring lately?

250
00:19:07,374 --> 00:19:09,708
I didn't want to overthink it.

251
00:19:09,708 --> 00:19:12,291
Hey, Bei Lv Qing.

252
00:19:12,291 --> 00:19:13,749
Are you still there?

253
00:19:13,749 --> 00:19:15,667
Let's talk business.

254
00:19:15,667 --> 00:19:17,957
No wonder when I asked Li Wen Xi
to collaborate the other day,

255
00:19:17,957 --> 00:19:19,874
he turned me down so flatly.

256
00:19:19,874 --> 00:19:23,749
How about I act as a bridge
and introduce you two?

257
00:19:23,749 --> 00:19:26,291
Enough. Let's talk business.

258
00:19:26,291 --> 00:19:29,041
It's good if Li Wen Xi is willing to cooperate,

259
00:19:29,041 --> 00:19:31,499
but if he isn't, there's no need to force it.

260
00:19:31,499 --> 00:19:32,666
Right?

261
00:19:33,332 --> 00:19:34,749
We don't need him.

262
00:19:34,749 --> 00:19:36,499
But if he's intent on sabotaging us,

263
00:19:36,499 --> 00:19:38,582
that would be quite troublesome.

264
00:19:38,582 --> 00:19:40,707
Why would I be afraid of him sabotaging me?

265
00:19:40,707 --> 00:19:41,749
Exactly.

266
00:19:41,749 --> 00:19:43,082
Don't forget,

267
00:19:43,082 --> 00:19:46,499
no matter how capable the Li family is,
that's in Hong Kong.

268
00:19:46,499 --> 00:19:47,832
This is our home turf.

269
00:19:47,832 --> 00:19:51,082
Playing here, he has to follow our lead.

270
00:19:52,167 --> 00:19:55,082
But Li Wen Xi has deep pockets.

271
00:19:55,082 --> 00:19:56,749
He has his family's backing.

272
00:19:56,749 --> 00:19:58,166
If he really starts dumping positions,

273
00:19:58,166 --> 00:20:00,291
we might not necessarily be his match.

274
00:20:00,291 --> 00:20:02,707
<i>The Chinese stock market is plummeting.</i>

275
00:20:02,707 --> 00:20:05,416
<i>From over 1,000 points to just over 300.</i>

276
00:20:05,416 --> 00:20:07,124
<i>It is akin to a cliff dive.</i>

277
00:20:07,124 --> 00:20:08,833
<i>A total freefall.</i>

278
00:20:08,833 --> 00:20:10,749
<i>That has been the general trend.</i>

279
00:20:10,749 --> 00:20:12,416
This is our first battle.

280
00:20:12,416 --> 00:20:14,291
The elders are all watching.

281
00:20:14,291 --> 00:20:15,832
We set the policies.

282
00:20:15,832 --> 00:20:17,582
We built the market.

283
00:20:17,582 --> 00:20:20,166
If this were in Hong Kong,
I wouldn't be so sure.

284
00:20:20,166 --> 00:20:23,749
But here, does Li Wen Xi even know how to play?

285
00:20:23,749 --> 00:20:25,582
He's just an outsider.

286
00:20:47,916 --> 00:20:49,624
What do you think of this place?

287
00:20:55,791 --> 00:20:58,041
It's... It's very nice.

288
00:20:59,374 --> 00:21:01,916
I'll find a way to transfer
to Austria next year.

289
00:21:01,916 --> 00:21:04,332
I'll settle down there.

290
00:21:04,332 --> 00:21:06,210
You're coming with me.

291
00:21:09,250 --> 00:21:11,750
Bei Lv Qing, can't you be more serious?

292
00:21:14,916 --> 00:21:16,916
Don't worry about the funds.

293
00:21:16,916 --> 00:21:20,582
The money will be
in your account tomorrow morning.

294
00:21:20,582 --> 00:21:22,541
Our accounts must be separate.

295
00:21:22,541 --> 00:21:24,666
There can't be any visible connection.

296
00:21:25,832 --> 00:21:27,791
I've already handled all of that.

297
00:21:28,916 --> 00:21:31,166
As expected of Mr. Bei. Reliable.

298
00:21:49,541 --> 00:21:50,999
Sell them all.

299
00:21:53,208 --> 00:21:55,250
Wh-What?

300
00:21:56,166 --> 00:21:57,946
Are you trading stocks?

301
00:21:58,999 --> 00:22:00,291
Sell them tomorrow.

302
00:22:00,291 --> 00:22:02,458
You're not suited for the financial market.

303
00:22:03,582 --> 00:22:05,249
With the little money you have,

304
00:22:05,249 --> 00:22:08,592
just put your salary into a fixed-term deposit.

305
00:22:11,124 --> 00:22:12,920
This is my secondary card.

306
00:22:13,749 --> 00:22:16,791
You don't need to ask me
when you want to use it.

307
00:22:18,708 --> 00:22:20,000
Big Bro.

308
00:22:20,666 --> 00:22:22,166
Aren't you...

309
00:22:22,166 --> 00:22:24,457
afraid I'll spend until you're bankrupt?

310
00:22:30,499 --> 00:22:32,124
You are mine.

311
00:22:32,124 --> 00:22:34,416
The things you buy are mine, too.

312
00:22:34,416 --> 00:22:36,124
How could I go bankrupt?

313
00:22:37,707 --> 00:22:39,541
Big Bro.

314
00:22:39,541 --> 00:22:41,082
I haven't showered yet, Big Bro.

315
00:22:41,082 --> 00:22:43,124
If you dare to provoke me,

316
00:22:43,124 --> 00:22:45,446
you'll have to pay the price.

317
00:22:48,000 --> 00:22:51,076
I... I haven't finished the apple.

318
00:22:53,499 --> 00:22:57,124
The top has been eaten,
but the bottom's waiting.

319
00:22:57,124 --> 00:22:59,249
We share the bitter and the sweet.

320
00:23:00,296 --> 00:23:01,588
Big Bro.

321
00:23:02,933 --> 00:23:04,874
- Fan Fan.
- Big Bro.

322
00:23:04,874 --> 00:23:06,791
- It's me, Fan Fan.
- Big Bro.

323
00:23:06,791 --> 00:23:08,124
Someone's here.

324
00:23:08,124 --> 00:23:09,624
- Someone's really here.
- Fan Fan.

325
00:23:10,792 --> 00:23:12,084
Fan Fan.

326
00:23:13,333 --> 00:23:15,250
It's me, Fan Fan.

327
00:23:16,792 --> 00:23:18,582
Brother?

328
00:23:18,582 --> 00:23:20,082
Why are you here?

329
00:23:23,957 --> 00:23:25,743
You've already eaten?

330
00:23:28,374 --> 00:23:29,749
Take it.

331
00:23:29,749 --> 00:23:31,957
You have no situational awareness at all.

332
00:23:31,957 --> 00:23:33,124
Why did you buy this?

333
00:23:33,124 --> 00:23:34,707
Look at what you're saying.

334
00:23:34,707 --> 00:23:36,749
I'm here to thank Lv Qing for finding me a job.

335
00:23:36,749 --> 00:23:37,916
How could I come empty-handed?

336
00:23:37,916 --> 00:23:39,916
You don't understand social etiquette at all.

337
00:23:41,958 --> 00:23:45,332
Look at this decor. It's really nice.

338
00:23:45,332 --> 00:23:47,916
It looks very relaxing.

339
00:23:50,082 --> 00:23:52,249
What style is this again?

340
00:23:52,249 --> 00:23:54,115
Mediterranean.

341
00:23:55,874 --> 00:23:57,749
- Hey, Lv Qing.
- Big Bro.

342
00:23:57,749 --> 00:23:59,521
Have you eaten?

343
00:24:01,999 --> 00:24:04,875
Didn't Xiao Fan just tell you?

344
00:24:04,875 --> 00:24:06,333
Lv Qing.

345
00:24:06,333 --> 00:24:10,178
I'm here to thank you.

346
00:24:10,178 --> 00:24:11,332
No need.

347
00:24:12,207 --> 00:24:14,041
Just thank your brother.

348
00:24:14,916 --> 00:24:16,416
Yes, yes.

349
00:24:16,416 --> 00:24:17,916
Ultimately, I know...

350
00:24:17,916 --> 00:24:20,749
Lv Qing, you only helped me because
of the relationship between our families.

351
00:24:20,749 --> 00:24:24,499
Otherwise, how could a man of your status

352
00:24:24,499 --> 00:24:27,249
bother with the affairs of commoners like us?

353
00:24:29,541 --> 00:24:30,791
Go cut some fruit for Lv Qing.

354
00:24:30,791 --> 00:24:32,416
Why are you just sitting here?

355
00:24:33,041 --> 00:24:36,166
No need. I just ate.

356
00:24:36,166 --> 00:24:38,249
Actually, I've wanted to come for a long time.

357
00:24:38,249 --> 00:24:39,582
But...

358
00:24:40,249 --> 00:24:43,916
I haven't achieved much at work yet.

359
00:24:43,916 --> 00:24:47,416
I was afraid I'd embarrass you, so...

360
00:24:47,416 --> 00:24:49,041
I was too ashamed to come.

361
00:24:49,766 --> 00:24:51,058
Lv Qing...

362
00:24:51,791 --> 00:24:54,166
Since you're such a wise person,

363
00:24:54,166 --> 00:24:57,249
I won't beat around the bush with you.

364
00:24:59,416 --> 00:25:03,041
I know you're a big client at Langjian.

365
00:25:03,041 --> 00:25:06,624
I just wanted to ask if you could...

366
00:25:06,624 --> 00:25:08,583
let me be your trader.

367
00:25:08,583 --> 00:25:09,625
Big Bro!

368
00:25:09,625 --> 00:25:12,957
Shen Zhi Qin is the top trader at Langjian.

369
00:25:12,957 --> 00:25:14,916
You're a rookie. How can you compare?

370
00:25:14,916 --> 00:25:16,749
We're family, let's be honest.

371
00:25:16,749 --> 00:25:18,499
I am a rookie, that's true.

372
00:25:18,499 --> 00:25:20,916
But is Shen Zhi Qin
as reliable as one of your own?

373
00:25:20,916 --> 00:25:22,916
Who knows what kind of shady business
he's doing behind your back.

374
00:25:22,916 --> 00:25:25,125
- Right?
- This is non-negotiable.

375
00:25:25,125 --> 00:25:28,926
Bro! Can't you just do your job properly?

376
00:25:28,926 --> 00:25:30,249
Xiao Fan.

377
00:25:30,249 --> 00:25:32,749
Why are you interrupting adults?

378
00:25:34,416 --> 00:25:37,332
I just want to work faithfully
for my own people.

379
00:25:37,332 --> 00:25:38,624
Let me put it this way.

380
00:25:38,624 --> 00:25:39,916
Shen Zhi Qin seems trustworthy.

381
00:25:39,916 --> 00:25:42,791
But the more flawless a person seems,
the bigger their hidden flaws are.

382
00:25:42,791 --> 00:25:44,624
Shen Zhi Qin watches the market all day.

383
00:25:44,624 --> 00:25:46,332
He doesn't say more than
three sentences to anyone.

384
00:25:46,332 --> 00:25:49,749
Don't you think this kind of trader
is a little too perfect?

385
00:25:53,291 --> 00:25:54,582
Fine.

386
00:25:56,624 --> 00:25:57,651
Big Bro!

387
00:25:57,651 --> 00:26:00,520
- He doesn't know anything.
- What do I need to know?

388
00:26:02,249 --> 00:26:04,832
I'll just follow wherever Lv Qing points.

389
00:26:04,832 --> 00:26:07,083
Besides, Lv Qing has
so much inside information.

390
00:26:07,083 --> 00:26:08,707
How could I lose money?

391
00:26:08,707 --> 00:26:10,166
Enough.

392
00:26:10,166 --> 00:26:11,832
I have things to do.

393
00:26:11,832 --> 00:26:13,916
You two brothers can talk.

394
00:26:18,999 --> 00:26:20,599
I'll leave you to it, Big Bro.

395
00:26:27,957 --> 00:26:30,541
Look at you, following him around
every single day.

396
00:26:30,541 --> 00:26:32,291
Cooking and serving tea.

397
00:26:32,291 --> 00:26:33,917
You're acting like a maid.

398
00:26:33,917 --> 00:26:35,917
What have you gained from it?

399
00:26:35,917 --> 00:26:39,457
Fine, I know how you are.

400
00:26:39,457 --> 00:26:40,916
Don't worry.

401
00:26:40,916 --> 00:26:44,487
When I strike it rich,
I definitely won't forget my little brother.

402
00:26:46,291 --> 00:26:47,416
I'm tired today.

403
00:26:47,416 --> 00:26:48,624
I'm going back now.

404
00:26:48,624 --> 00:26:51,062
Think about what I told you.

405
00:26:58,624 --> 00:27:01,582
Big Bro, what were you doing last night?

406
00:27:01,582 --> 00:27:04,041
I didn't even notice when you got back.

407
00:27:04,041 --> 00:27:07,494
Do I have to report everything I do to you now?

408
00:27:08,774 --> 00:27:10,516
That's not what I meant.

409
00:27:12,124 --> 00:27:13,757
Come and eat.

410
00:27:26,542 --> 00:27:27,749
Big Bro.

411
00:27:27,749 --> 00:27:29,999
You really don't have to mind Lu Xiao Ping.

412
00:27:29,999 --> 00:27:33,539
No matter what he says to you,
don't agree to it.

413
00:27:34,707 --> 00:27:37,082
Wouldn't that be more troublesome?

414
00:27:37,082 --> 00:27:38,416
You people from the Lu family

415
00:27:38,416 --> 00:27:41,357
never give up until you get what you want.

416
00:27:42,105 --> 00:27:44,147
If he wants to do it, let him.

417
00:28:00,249 --> 00:28:02,791
Why did you come to see me during work?

418
00:28:02,791 --> 00:28:04,916
Did you get into trouble?

419
00:28:04,916 --> 00:28:07,124
Can't you wish your brother well?

420
00:28:07,124 --> 00:28:08,592
It's really nothing?

421
00:28:09,291 --> 00:28:11,791
I got my first paycheck today.
Guess how much it is.

422
00:28:11,791 --> 00:28:13,390
Over 10,000 yuan.

423
00:28:14,166 --> 00:28:15,707
Then work hard.

424
00:28:15,707 --> 00:28:17,207
Keep your feet on the ground.

425
00:28:17,207 --> 00:28:19,233
Which one of us is the older brother?

426
00:28:20,087 --> 00:28:22,969
If there's nothing else,
I'm going back to work.

427
00:28:23,588 --> 00:28:25,058
Look at you...

428
00:28:26,416 --> 00:28:28,029
Actually, there is something.

429
00:28:29,499 --> 00:28:31,249
What do you want?

430
00:28:31,249 --> 00:28:34,498
The Ministry of Agriculture will release
some big news in the next few months.

431
00:28:34,498 --> 00:28:35,499
It's top secret.

432
00:28:35,499 --> 00:28:38,332
Bei Lv Qing and his people
must have known the details long ago.

433
00:28:38,332 --> 00:28:40,749
Lu Tao is following him so closely.

434
00:28:40,749 --> 00:28:43,291
He definitely wants to hitch a ride.

435
00:28:43,291 --> 00:28:45,624
Just keep a close eye
on the market for Big Bro.

436
00:28:45,624 --> 00:28:47,041
Don't worry about anything else.

437
00:28:47,041 --> 00:28:49,249
Everyone wants to get in on such a big deal.

438
00:28:49,249 --> 00:28:50,999
Can't you keep your ears open?

439
00:28:51,749 --> 00:28:54,249
You might not want in, but your brother does.

440
00:28:55,207 --> 00:28:56,916
It takes 300,000 to open an account.

441
00:28:56,916 --> 00:28:58,582
Where would you get that much money?

442
00:28:58,582 --> 00:29:00,416
Why worry about that?

443
00:29:02,332 --> 00:29:04,499
You're such a blockhead.

444
00:29:04,499 --> 00:29:06,177
I can't get through to you.

445
00:29:16,582 --> 00:29:17,749
What's wrong?

446
00:29:17,749 --> 00:29:19,124
Is something the matter?

447
00:29:22,458 --> 00:29:26,492
Actually, it's nothing.

448
00:29:29,124 --> 00:29:31,479
I can tell when something's on your mind.

449
00:29:33,749 --> 00:29:36,845
Is my brother doing... all right at work?

450
00:29:37,666 --> 00:29:40,707
You don't have to worry about his affairs.

451
00:29:40,707 --> 00:29:43,624
I'm just afraid he'll cause you trouble.

452
00:29:43,624 --> 00:29:46,082
I'm not even worried about that.

453
00:29:53,667 --> 00:29:55,750
- Is your brother in?
- Yeah.

454
00:29:58,249 --> 00:29:59,624
Eating so early?

455
00:29:59,624 --> 00:30:00,916
Have something on later?

456
00:30:00,916 --> 00:30:02,041
What's up?

457
00:30:02,041 --> 00:30:05,582
The great Mr. Lin
doesn't usually drop by for a visit.

458
00:30:05,582 --> 00:30:07,416
Fine, fine. I shouldn't have teased you.

459
00:30:07,416 --> 00:30:09,093
Let's talk business.

